WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:42.830
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:50.200
With our memories fading

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:57.280
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.610 --> 00:01:04.180
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:38.730
Even Obelisk's greatest effect, Soul Energy MAX, couldn't defeat Ra.

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:44.710
But my deck contains servants who fought alongside me in Battle City!

00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:49.770
I borrow all their strength to activate Ragnarok!

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:55.030
To destroy you and Ra's Fusion Monster, Marik!

00:01:55.030 --> 00:02:01.030
Battle City Concludes!

00:02:07.150 --> 00:02:08.440
That's...

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:09.910
Rishido.

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:20.460
You're still alive, Rishido?

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:22.300
You're tough.

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:28.190
But you can't switch my personalities anymore.

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:30.630
Rishido...

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.040
Are you OK, Rishido?

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:39.280
You can barely walk.  Don't push yourself!

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.290
Hey!

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:44.780
Please leave him be.

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.710
That's what Rishido wants.

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:57.300
What a ghastly tattoo.

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:59.820
But it's worthless now.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:03.420
The other personality has little strength left.

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:08.120
He doesn't have the power to replace me, much less to live.

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:17.540
Master Marik, the gravekeepers' cruel destiny caused tragedy for the Ishtars.

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:22.580
Hate and anger created the evil inside you.

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:28.030
Be quiet!

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:29.720
Marik!  How dare you!

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:37.260
Don't!

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:41.520
Be quiet!

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:44.330
Rishido!

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:55.720
Master Marik, you're throwing yourself deeper into the darkness of despair.

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:57.410
Silence!

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:01.940
Rishido!

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:04.960
I'm... fine.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:14.770
Even if you're lost in the darkness, you must keep living.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:20.140
Not because you're a gravekeeper, but because you're human!

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:22.770
A human...

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:26.050
I said be quiet!

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:33.930
Look, my other self!  He's acting strange!

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:34.790
Marik.

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:40.890
Master Marik.

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:44.100
A person doesn't pursue the light.

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:46.580
There's light because you're alive!

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.640
Why?

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:59.880
You shouldn't have this power anymore!

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:03.580
Yugi!  Attack me!

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:04.880
Marik!

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:08.660
Be quiet!  Stay down!

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:11.600
I've committed unforgivable sins.

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:18.200
I hated the Pharaoh for giving my family this unavoidable destiny.

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:21.120
So I created this other personality.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.770
I said be quiet!

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:29.770
The darkness in my heart created this evil monster.

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:31.810
Master Marik...

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:35.930
But can I still yearn for the light?

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:37.750
Be quiet!

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:42.260
Can I put an end to the hatred and sorrow?

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:45.690
Yugi, all will be clear if you attack.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.120
Be quiet!

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:49.790
Hurry!  Attack me!

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.340
My other self, Marik is serious.

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:56.580
He's willing to risk everything on this attack.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:06:00.900
Yeah.  I can feel his conviction.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:08.040
Okay.  I'll believe in the strength of your 1 life point!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.980
Here I go, Marik!

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:13.220
I activate my spell, Ragnarok!

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:21.660
I can activate Ragnarok when Dark Magician and Dark Magician Girl are on the field!

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:28.170
By banishing all monsters in my deck, hand and graveyard...

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:30.800
...all your monsters are destroyed!

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:32.400
D-Don't do it...

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:34.940
Even if it's a God!

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.230
Slifer!

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:47.370
And Obelisk!

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:01.760
All of Yugi's monsters are appearing!

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:04.940
Wow!

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:10.560
Stop!  Stay away!

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:27.100
Unhand me!

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:54.480
Black Burning Magic!

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:24.710
Wow!  He destroyed Ra!

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:26.150
Did Yugi win?

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:27.420
No...

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:31.120
Marik still has 1 life point left.

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:37.060
My other self attacked, believing in the strength of Marik's last life point.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.460
Please be alive.

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:40.500
Marik...

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:44.510
Master Marik...

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:45.870
Marik...

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:05.190
Marik!

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:07.790
Marik's expression is different.

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:09.860
Is his dark side gone?

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:17.970
Master Marik, the will to live inside your heart defeated the evil.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:22.940
Yugi, I still have 1 life point.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.840
The duel isn't over yet!

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:29.290
My other self!  Look!

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:34.430
What?

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:38.820
Marik's true self has switched places with his dark side.

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:45.260
Impossible!  He escaped death, pushed me out and regained his body?

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:47.380
You must be kidding!

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:51.700
I'm now the sacrifice with only 1 life point left?

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.930
Hey, true self!

00:09:53.930 --> 00:09:57.640
We're friends who shared the same body!

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:02.010
Even with 1 life point, we can still win this duel.

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:03.540
Kill Yugi!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.510
He took everything from you!  It's your destiny!

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:08.700
Get your revenge!

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:15.420
My evil side, I created you due to my cruel fate.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:19.390
You can no longer control me!

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:21.060
What?

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:24.500
I'll erase you myself!

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:47.820
No way!  He's going to destroy his own body so that he can destroy me too?

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:49.560
Marik...

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.580
I won't die.

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:57.000
But my sins will never be erased.

00:10:57.260 --> 00:11:03.200
But I'll live carrying that burden, along with the engravings on my back.

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:08.640
My destiny is covered in darkness, but I'll strive for that single point of light.

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:10.310
Master Marik...

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:14.750
Yugi-  I mean, the soul of the Pharaoh.

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:19.660
Thank you for saving me in this duel.

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:23.640
It can't be...  Don't do it!

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:36.320
The Ishtars' 3,000-year long destiny as gravekeepers...

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:47.560
This dark destiny led to tragedy, and I must end it...

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:50.180
...with my own hand.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:54.020
This is how I'll atone for my sins.

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:55.190
Stop!

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:57.120
It's the first step...

00:11:58.340 --> 00:12:00.360
...to move to the light.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:03.500
He's surrendering?

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:07.280
By admitting defeat, his life points drop to 0!

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:13.640
Surrender...?  No way...

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.450
Vanish, my dark self!

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:28.350
I lose, Pharaoh!

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:38.760
My other self!

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:40.030
Partner!

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:44.970
Marik, we still have a future.

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:47.980
Thank you, Pharaoh.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:49.910
Master Marik...

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:54.850
Marik, you won the duel inside your heart.

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:02.120
The winner of the Battle City Finals is Yugi Muto!

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:05.130
All right!  Way to go, Yugi!

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:06.430
You did it!

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:11.110
Yugi!

00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:12.400
You're awesome!

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:14.600
You did it!

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:15.100
Yugi!

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:19.280
Every single card that helped me...

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:22.020
And my friends...

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:24.980
Thank you!

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:26.820
Marik.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.820
Sis, I...

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:38.990
It was your duty to end the gravekeepers' destiny that lasted for thousands of years.

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:43.930
It was foolish to spend so much time on revenge and hatred.

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:55.380
Maybe the Ishtars had to protect the Pharaoh's memories to learn this message from him.

00:13:55.920 --> 00:14:02.050
Sis, do you think our tribe can live outside the darkness?

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:06.480
Yes.  We three are more than a tribe.

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:07.910
We're family.

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:12.780
As long as we have this bond, we can overcome any obstacle.

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:14.030
Sis!

00:14:14.030 --> 00:14:15.630
Yugi!

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:21.070
You now have the title as Battle City's Duel King.

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:25.010
As the tournament's sponsor, I grant you this glory.

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:30.940
Kaiba, I couldn't have won if you didn't give me that card.

00:14:30.940 --> 00:14:36.820
Due to the rules, Yugi gets an ante card from Marik.

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:41.180
Marik, it's time to fulfill the Ishtars' final mission.

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:41.960
Yes.

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:55.130
Yugi, your friends who lost their Shadow Games will be freed and regain consciousness.

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:57.020
Really?

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:57.820
All right!

00:14:57.820 --> 00:14:58.800
Mai!

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:02.610
And me.

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.380
Yugi, here's a God Card.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.480
The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:12.720
Slifer the Sky Dragon.

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.800
Obelisk the Tormentor.

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:18.890
I've finally acquired the three God Cards.

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:24.360
These three cards contain the secret of my other self's memories.

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:26.540
But what is it?

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:35.540
And here's the key to the Pharaoh's locked memories that the gravekeepers have kept safe.

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:41.360
That looks painful.

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:43.090
How cruel.

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:44.420
These scars...

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:51.290
The gravekeepers suffered pain to protect the secret of my memories?

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:57.860
It's a message from a gravekeeper prophet who served the royal family 3,000 years ago.

00:15:57.860 --> 00:16:02.820
The one who acquires the three Gods' tablets...

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:06.640
...proves that he houses the Pharaoh's soul.

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:13.570
Yugi, you proved that you are the Pharaoh by acquiring the three God Cards.

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:17.250
You may learn the location of your memories, indicated here.

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:22.310
Yugi, can you read this?

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:23.260
Yeah.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:30.080
I sense something.  Not by this ancient text, but by these three God Cards.

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:37.070
It's that stone tablet!

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:41.800
Are my memories sealed inside that tablet?

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:46.780
My mission is now complete.  And lastly...

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:48.680
The Millennium Rod.

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:53.000
Please take the Millennium Item that my family has kept safe.

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:55.900
And the Millennium Ring.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:01.130
Finished enjoying the aftertaste of victory?

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:05.000
The Battle City Tournament is now over!

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:10.440
Yugi, I'll let you have the title and pride as the Duel King for now.

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:18.260
I no longer need Battle City's final destination, the Duel Tower.

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:22.680
So I'll blow up the tower in an hour!

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:24.200
W-What?

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:26.350
What are you thinking, Kaiba?

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:32.290
Everyone should get onboard the Battle Ship and leave Alcatraz.

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:36.900
What?  I thought the engines were broken.

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:38.710
Don't worry.

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:41.680
They've been repaired.  Right, Isono?

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:42.570
Y-Yes.

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:44.200
That's all.

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:47.010
We have to hurry!

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:50.420
Kaiba is such a sore loser!

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.950
What's Kaiba thinking?

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:06.460
It's ready, big brother.

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:09.860
Are you sure, Mokuba?

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:13.940
Yeah!  I'm with you all the way!

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:15.570
Inputting password.

00:18:20.520 --> 00:18:23.180
Input complete.

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:28.490
Let's do this, big brother.

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:33.450
Farewell, the ghost of Gozaburo.

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:36.890
1, 2, 3!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:42.220
Self-destruction sequence activated. One hour to detonation.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:46.060
Everyone!  Hurry!

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:50.170
Mai!  Are you awake?

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:51.940
Brother...

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:54.160
Shizuka, how's Mai?

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:55.380
She's...

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:57.170
What?

00:18:58.900 --> 00:18:59.700
No!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:02.780
Mai...  This can't be!

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:04.580
You must be joking!

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:08.160
Mai!  Mai!  Why?

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:11.230
Don't die!  Don't die, Mai!

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:14.400
Don't die, Mai!

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:25.440
M-Mai?

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:32.340
Jonouchi, are you crying?

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:36.560
That makes me so happy!  You really care about me!

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:40.180
W-Whatever!  You tricked me!

00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:44.220
See, Shizuka?  I told you it'd work.

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:47.080
Because he's not so smart.

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:48.520
Shizuka!

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:51.200
Sorry, brother.

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:53.700
Don't scare me like that.

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:54.870
I was shocked.

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:58.200
Yugi, I heard you won.  Congrats!

00:19:58.620 --> 00:19:59.740
Thanks.

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:01.560
Last up is Bakura.

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:03.290
Where did he go?

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:11.750
Bakura?

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:13.380
Hi, everyone!

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:15.020
I'm glad I found you.

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:17.130
That's what we're supposed to say!

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:19.060
Where have you been?

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:22.520
I don't know.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.940
When I woke up, I was in bed.

00:20:24.940 --> 00:20:27.300
And I got hungry.

00:20:27.730 --> 00:20:29.570
You...

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:31.080
What?

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:34.010
Mr. Seto and Mr. Mokuba aren't back yet?

00:20:34.320 --> 00:20:36.320
Where did they go?

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:37.810
We're out of time!

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:40.500
What did you say about Kaiba?

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:42.840
He's not on the Battle Ship.

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:44.130
What?

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:46.050
What's Kaiba doing?

00:20:46.460 --> 00:20:49.640
Maybe losing to Yugi crushed him, so...

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:50.990
No way!

00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:52.990
That can't be true.

00:20:52.990 --> 00:20:56.760
Knowing him, he probably already left.

00:20:56.760 --> 00:20:58.660
But what if he didn't?

00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:01.430
He's right.  We can't just leave him.

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:03.880
Fine.  Let's go look for them.

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:04.880
Right.

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:08.980
You prepare for takeoff.

00:21:08.980 --> 00:21:11.640
Sheesh, always giving us trouble.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:14.260
No choice.  Start the engines!

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:16.820
Roger!  Starting the compressor!

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:18.740
Voltage, check!  Fuel, check!

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:20.140
Starter, contact!

00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:28.560
What's wrong?

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:33.140
The engines stopped.

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:34.430
What?

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:36.900
I thought they were fixed!

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:39.870
Oh no!  What'll happen to us?

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:45.240
45 minutes to detonation.

00:21:55.820 --> 00:22:00.450
After saying this island will explode, Kaiba and Mokuba haven't returned.

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:04.460
Are they planning to sink into the ocean, along with the island?

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:08.510
And the Battle Ship's engines are malfunctioning, so we can't fly.

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:12.210
We have to find them and stop the timer!

00:22:12.210 --> 00:22:14.700
There's no time left until detonation!

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:17.680
Kaiba and Mokuba, where are you?

00:22:17.680 --> 00:22:20.680
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Alcatraz in Flames

00:22:20.680 --> 00:22:22.280
Duel, standby!

00:22:29.770 --> 00:22:38.680
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:39.180 --> 00:22:47.020
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:48.750 --> 00:22:58.180
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:58.800 --> 00:23:07.700
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:23:08.270 --> 00:23:16.730
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:23:17.510 --> 00:23:22.240
